rows.en:
"Sorry about that. We had a little internal squabble.
Oh, {c}{f:|}!
Could we have a little word later?
...Now then, who's telling the last story?"
Hold on a minute!
What does he mean, a little word{f:?|?}
...Anyway, that doesn't matter right now{f:.|.}
There are six people here, so unless a seventh shows up, the next story {f:will be|has to be} the last.
I {f:have to|have to} hear the last person's story...{p}

"Kazama, come on, that's going way too far.
Please tell us a serious story."
{f:I|I} found myself saying that to Kazama.{p}

"Our eyes have degenerated, you see.
Look..."
Kazama jabbed his fingers into his own eyes and gouged them out.{p}

"Kazama, what are you doing?"
Suddenly, still in that position, Kazama snapped his fingers.
Something went rumble, rumble, rumble.{p}

"{f:Whoaaaaaa|Eeeeeeek}! It's an earthquake{f:!|!}"
{f:I|I} have to get under a desk, fast!
What on earth is {f:going on|going on}?
It's shaking like crazy{f:!|!}
"It's okay, I'll stop it right away."
He said.{p}

"Looks like the earthquake control device is broken☆
What do I do?!"
Don't give me 'what do I do'{f:☆|☆}
At this rate, this whole area is going to collapse{f:!|!}{p}

Right now, everyone is waiting in the rift between dimensions for the results of our survey of Earth.
Our comrades are scouting out other places we might move to, as well, but it's not going too well.
Still, for now Earth is our top candidate for migration.{p}

It all happened in an instant.
What on earth {f:was|was} that?
And those strange words Kazama spoke just now...?{p}

I can't wait.
It's so exciting.
Well, that's the end of my story.
Next person, take it away."
Ah, just thinking about it is going to drive me crazy{f:.|.}
...Is he really a being from another dimension{f:?|?}{p}

"{c}{f:|}, you lied to me just now, didn't you?
It's too late for regrets.
{c}{f:|}, what do you think this is?"{p}

Kazama took a small piece of metal out of his pocket.
............{f:What|What}? It's just an ordinary school badge{f:.|.}
I wish he wouldn't scare me like that{f:.|.}{p}

A tremendous flash of light engulfed {f:us|us}.
He really was an alien{f:.|.}
What an idiot {f:I|I} {f:am|am}.
...It's too late now{f:, isn't it|, isn't it}...{p}

"Kazama, come on, that's going way too far.
Please tell us a serious story."
{f:I|I} found myself saying that to Kazama.{p}

Going along with this stuff... {f:I|I} really am too nice for my own good{f:...|...}
But a tiny part of me thought maybe, just maybe, so {f:I|I} held out.
"Okay, that's enough. Open your eyes."
He said.{p}

{f:I|I}'m going to become a yokai?
{f:Quit joking around|Don't be ridiculous}.
...But the next full moon is only three days away{f:, I think|, isn't it}.
There's nothing to worry {f:about|about}. I just won't believe a word Kazama says{f:.|.}
...I just won't believe it.{p}

"Huh?"
Kazama looked surprised; he hadn't expected that.
But he soon said with a big smile:{p}
